OL,3,GNEWSANew plans approved for Forest
OL,4,Astadium expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major expansion of Nottingham
OL,7,FForest's stadium has been given the
OL,8,Fgreen light.
OL,10,FThe club plans to increase the City
OL,11,FGround's capacity from 31,000 to 52,500
OL,12,Fin two stages, at an estimated cost of
OL,13,F#790m.
OL,15,FThe proposals were approved by
OL,16,FRushcliffe Borough Council's planning
OL,17,Fcommittee on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
