OL,3,GNEWSANew plans approved for Forest
OL,4,Astadium expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FSubject to a range of conditions, full
OL,7,Fplanning permission has been granted to
OL,8,Fdemolish and replace the Peter Taylor
OL,9,FStand and to redevelop the Trent End,
OL,10,Fwhich combined would take the ground's
OL,11,Fcapacity to 45,000.
